# Prowse-TUI
Programmable, headless browsing from a keyboard driven terminal interface.

## Navigation
@key j / Down     move down
@key k / Up       move up
@key Space / b    page down / page up
@key g / G        jump to top / bottom
@key Enter / l    activate a help link or config row
@key h / Left     back in browser/help; close config
@key Esc          close help/config or a result panel

## Help
- Commands help:commands
- Search help:search
- Configuration help:config
- Extensions help:extensions

